  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Zui Xian Weng meets Green Ant Ascetic’s will at a hidden inheritance site and confirms the will’s wife is Wine Fairy. The couple hid the site so a traitorous disciple could not find them; over a million years have passed since their death. After Zui Xian Weng vows to oppose Fang Yuan for the true inheritance, Green Ant’s will has him accept the inheritance, which includes the food path killer move golden bottle drunken wine that the couple created together.",
      "chapters": [
        2110
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zui_xian_weng",
        "char_green_ant_ascetic",
        "char_wine_fairy",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The inheritance holds Green Ant Ascetic’s enslavement path inheritance and Wine Fairy’s food path true inheritance; Zui Xian Weng finds the enslavement path line of little value to him and the Wine Fairy true inheritance extremely valuable.",
      "chapters": [
        2110
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_green_ant_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Ding Ling traps Zui Xian Weng as he leaves and treats the find as his to keep.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-contact",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_ding_ling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court already knew of the site; Qin Ding Ling waited three days on intuition and traps him when he exits. She says Green Ant Ascetic’s and Wine Fairy’s inheritances are good, but that Heavenly Court will not seize them, and that since he found the inheritance it belongs to him. She asks him to write a copy of the true inheritance and says Heavenly Court will try to provide relevant Immortal Gu, and she tells him to return to Eastern Sea and join the Righteous Qi Alliance without a formal agreement Fang Yuan might notice.",
      "chapters": [
        2110
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-contact",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "fac_righteous_qi_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Ding Ling later tells Fang Zheng that the inheritance’s greatest value is not golden bottle drunken wine but the human path wine drinker Immortal Gu recipe in the inheritance Green Ant Ascetic and Wine Fairy created together.",
      "chapters": [
        2110
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-contact",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "gu_wine_drinker_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After taking the couple’s true inheritance, Zui Xian Weng returns east as Qin Ding Ling’s planted piece.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "return-as-a-chess-piece",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After he inherits Green Ant Ascetic and Wine Fairy’s true inheritance in Central Continent, Qin Ding Ling silently persuades him to act as a chess piece; he returns to Eastern Sea, rests, then sides with the Righteous Qi Alliance.",
      "chapters": [
        2137
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
